    "catalogue_tags": [],
    "catalogue_description": "This map features UGX Mod v1.0.3! For a full list of features, click here . Hey everyone! Kino der toten is here, It might look a bit different, but I tried to make it look similar as much as I can. Thanks to tomikaze for suggesting that I should add the UGX mod in this map Features: UGX Mod Standalone. Kino style teleporter. Note: Unfortunately I had to make it a one-way map in order for zones to work correctly, so you can\u2019t open the door downstairs. It can only be opened from the other side. Also, the map has no traps. Credits: UGX team for sharing such an awesome mod. Tom_BMX for tools and tuts. Treminaor for the detailed tutorial videos. I hope you enjoy!",
